      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:0",
      "text": "Bulk edit for invoices ships Thursday. Last thing before then is support."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:1",
      "text": "Do the usual handoff to support, then. They hate surprises."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:2",
      "text": "I'll do the usual handoff tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:3",
      "text": "Thanks. Any known issues they should hear about?"
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:4",
      "text": "One. Bulk edit skips invoices that are locked for payment, and it doesn't say why."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:5",
      "text": "I'll put that in the known issues section."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:6",
      "text": "And let's fix the message in the next sprint."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:7",
      "text": "I'll file the ticket."
    },
    {
      "id": "heldout-same-reading-usual-handoff:seg:8",
      "text": "Good. Thanks."
    }
